OL,3,GNEWSAFinucane inquiry to consider
OL,4,Awhether MI5 propaganda 'legitimised'
OL,5,Alawyer as target
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn inquiry into the murder of solicitor
OL,8,FPat Finucane will consider whether a
OL,9,Fsecurity service propaganda campaign
OL,10,F"legitimised" the lawyer as a target
OL,11,Ffor loyalist paramilitaries.
OL,13,FThe 39-year-old solicitor was shot dead
OL,14,Fat his home in north Belfast by the UDA
OL,15,Fin front of his wife and children in
OL,16,FFebruary 1989.
OL,18,FSeveral examinations of the case have
OL,19,Ffound evidence of state collusion.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
