OL,4,Awhether MI5 propaganda 'legitimised'
OL,5,Alawyer as target
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe third day of hearings in the
OL,8,Finquiry, which formally opened in June,
OL,9,Fheard more information about the murder
OL,10,Fwhich is already in the public domain.
